    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20745" root="سمق" body-key="s">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَمَقَ</span></b> , (S, O, L, K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَمُقَ</span></b> , (O, L,) inf. n.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُمُوقٌ</span> (S, O, L, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَمْقٌ</span>, (L,) <i>It was,</i> or
<i>became, high,</i> or <i>tall:</i> (S, O, L, K:) or <i>tall in the
highest degree:</i> (JK:) said of a plant, or herbage,
(JK, L,) of a tree, and [particularly] of a palmtree. (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُمَاقٌ</span>.

